00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.471
There's no rest for me in this world.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.592
<i>Perhaps in the next.</i>

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:30.316
Arthur.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:33.717
