00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:38.792
Oh, no, no.

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.434
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:53.200
Oh, no, no.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.240
